  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7607701",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Nefer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760770101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760770101": {
            "id": "760770101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Sarin",
            "text": "Here you go, Lady Nefer — the book you were looking for.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770102"
            ]
          },
          "760770102": {
            "id": "760770102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Let me see... Ha, would you look at that? Finally, an actual copy of \"The Man Who Became a Mule.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770103"
            ]
          },
          "760770103": {
            "id": "760770103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is that... Nefer? Surely she can't be here for a commission?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770104"
            ]
          },
          "760770104": {
            "id": "760770104",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yeah, Nefer doesn't seem like the kind of person who \"takes\" commissions... More like the kind who dishes them out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770107"
            ]
          },
          "760770107": {
            "id": "760770107",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, if you start taking work from Nefer, there'll be none left for Jahoda...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770108"
            ]
          },
          "760770108": {
            "id": "760770108",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, what sort of job is Nefer delegating to the Adventurers' Guild? Paimon's kinda curious..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7607702",
      "subQuestName": "Return to the Curatorium of Secrets with Nefer",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "760770201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "760770201": {
            "id": "760770201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "...Huh, looks like Jahoda's not back yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770202"
            ]
          },
          "760770202": {
            "id": "760770202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Wait here. I'll go brew some tea.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770203"
            ]
          },
          "760770203": {
            "id": "760770203",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ashru",
            "text": "Meow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770204"
            ]
          },
          "760770204": {
            "id": "760770204",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here, kitty kitty...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770205"
            ]
          },
          "760770205": {
            "id": "760770205",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ashru",
            "text": "Meow, meow meow!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770206"
            ]
          },
          "760770206": {
            "id": "760770206",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, who's a good kitty... C'mon, shake!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770207"
            ]
          },
          "760770207": {
            "id": "760770207",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ashru",
            "text": "Meow?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770208"
            ]
          },
          "760770208": {
            "id": "760770208",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Alright, help yourselves. Cream and sugar is over there if you need it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770209"
            ]
          },
          "760770209": {
            "id": "760770209",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Looks like Ashru's taken a real liking to you. Back when I first brought him home, he was as fierce as a little lion.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770210"
            ]
          },
          "760770210": {
            "id": "760770210",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "He didn't let anyone get close except for me. Anybody else who tried would have his little fangs and claws to contend with...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770211"
            ]
          },
          "760770211": {
            "id": "760770211",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seriously? You'd never guess he used to be aggressive...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770212"
            ]
          },
          "760770212": {
            "id": "760770212",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Ashru",
            "text": "Meow, meow meow? Meow...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770213"
            ]
          },
          "760770213": {
            "id": "760770213",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "That was a long time ago, when the two of us had just arrived in Nod-Krai.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770214"
            ]
          },
          "760770214": {
            "id": "760770214",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Back then, we had no one to rely on but ourselves. And to survive in a place like Nod-Krai... We had no choice but to bare our claws and teeth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770215"
            ]
          },
          "760770215": {
            "id": "760770215",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "...Of course, things are different now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770216"
            ]
          },
          "760770216": {
            "id": "760770216",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Anyway, it's about time we satisfied that curiosity of yours. I'm guessing you want to know more about my \"long-term partnership\" with the Adventurers' Guild?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770219"
            ]
          },
          "760770219": {
            "id": "760770219",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You mean like, some kind of extra special treasure even Nefer can't get her hands on?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770220"
            ]
          },
          "760770220": {
            "id": "760770220",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "It's special, no doubt about that. But whether it counts as \"treasure\"... Well, that depends on how you see it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770221"
            ]
          },
          "760770221": {
            "id": "760770221",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Nefer",
            "text": "Here, this is the book I asked the Adventurers' Guild to find for me. Take a look.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760770222"
            ]
          },
          "760770222": {
            "id": "760770222",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, it's like a... fairytale from Sumeru!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}